Breaks: rpmini-session (<< 0.2.0)
Replaces: rpmini-session (<< 0.2.0)
Description: Retroid Pocket Mini board support for hako
 Board support for the Retroid Pocket Mini (SM8250) booted by OpenABL:
  - installs the kernel, initrd and DTBs to the FAT boot partition and
    writes the Boot Loader Specification entry (rpmini-update-esp)
  - ALSA UCM profile for the speakers / headphones (from ROCKNIX) and the
    WirePlumber settings for it
  - USB-C device mode: CDC-NCM network (192.168.7.2) and CDC-ACM serial
  - built-in pad and touch panel (udev rules), the session defaults for the
    portrait panel and the pad (/usr/lib/hako/session.d/10-rpmini.sh) and
    the volume keys without PipeWire (/usr/lib/hako/hw/volume)
